          {
            "details": "Binds Meta's exact public checkpoint to the official Muse-specific vLLM CUDA 13 ARM64 image, dedicated reasoning and tool parsers, offline local model hydration, and a read-only local image-input contract. The 32K context and one-sequence limit preserve unified-memory headroom until a physical GB10 multimodal canary supports raising them.",
